"text":"今日で、前期の期末テストが\n終了しました〜！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やった〜！\n解放された〜！(> <)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"単位がどうなるか\nまだ不安だけど..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無事終わった事に\n喜びを感じます(> <)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして全てのテストを受けられるように\nいつも仕事の調節をしてくれる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マネージャーさん方には\n頭が上がりません(> <)。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有難いです。\n感謝ばかりです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして頑張れって\n応援してくれた皆さん！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました\\( ˆoˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒に頑張ろうって言ってくれた方もいて\n物凄く心強かった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/29/1800316/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にこにこ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日の #chihashot"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/29/1800316/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ユニバの帰りに、\n綺麗な夕日が見えたよ(｡･o･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"brea